---
import DemoLayout from '../layouts/DemoLayout.astro';
import { kindMeta, themeMeta, kinds, themes } from '../data';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<DemoLayout title="Astro Workshop · 8 UI Demos + Blocks" description="Astro 工作坊 2 種網站架構 × 4 種視覺人格">
  <main class="demo-index">
    <header class="index-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">ASTRO WORKSHOP · UI CRAFT LAB</p>
      <h1>兩種網站任務，四種視覺人格。</h1>
      <p>這不是八套互不相干的網站，而是 <strong>2 種內容架構 × 4 種 Design System</strong>。點進去比較同一套設計語言如何因「網站任務」而改變。</p>
    </header>
    <div class="matrix">
      {kinds.map((kind)=><section class="matrix-group">
        <div class="matrix-heading">
          <span>{kind === 'knowledge' ? 'A' : 'B'}</span>
          <div><h2>{kindMeta[kind].label}</h2><p>{kindMeta[kind].intro}</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="demo-grid">
          {themes.map((theme)=><a class={`demo-card theme-${theme}`} href={`${base}${kind}/${theme}/`}>
            <div class="demo-swatch"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <small>{themeMeta[theme].label}</small>
            <h3>{themeMeta[theme].zh}</h3>
            <p>{themeMeta[theme].mood}</p>
            <b>開啟 Demo →</b>
          </a>)}
        </div>
      </section>)}
    </div>
    <section class="matrix-group blocks-entry" aria-labelledby="blocks-title">
      <div class="matrix-heading">
        <span>C</span>
        <div><h2 id="blocks-title">元件庫 · 自由組裝你的網站</h2><p>不只能選完整網站，也能挑選喜歡的首頁、文章與服務區塊。探索 34 個可重用元件，包含四套配色、文章搜尋、標籤、月份日曆與進階文章排版。記下元件名稱，就能交給 AI 組裝。</p></div>
      </div>
      <a class="demo-card" href={`${base}blocks/`} style="display:block;max-width:750px">
        <p class="eyebrow">ASTRO BLOCKS · V2</p>
        <h3>元件庫 + 展示站 + 完整網站範例</h3>
        <p>V1.5 的 23 個核心元件，加上 V2 新增的 11 個文章探索與排版元件。可預覽效果、切換風格，並開啟八款完整網站範例。</p>
        <b>進入元件展示站 →</b>
      </a>
    </section>
    <section class="matrix-group blocks-entry" aria-labelledby="v2-demo-title">
      <div class="matrix-heading">
        <span>D</span>
        <div><h2 id="v2-demo-title">V2 · 互動功能 Demo</h2><p>不只有元件展示：直接操作文章搜尋、標籤雲、月份列表和日曆，點選日期找到真實存在的示範文章。</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="demo-grid">
        <a class="demo-card theme-paper" href={base+'knowledge/paper/explore/'}>
          <small>KNOWLEDGE / PAPER</small><h3>文章探索站</h3><p>試著搜尋 Astro、點擊月份與日曆，再打開紙墨風格的文章詳情頁。</p><b>體驗 V2 文章探索 →</b>
        </a>
        <a class="demo-card theme-botanical" href={base+'helper/botanical/explore/'}>
          <small>HELPER / BOTANICAL</small><h3>助人者文章探索</h3><p>使用植感配色與同一套探索功能；文章內頁可操作折疊、Grid、比較表與輪播。</p><b>體驗 V2 跨風格 →</b>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <footer class="index-footer">Research → Structure → Visual System → Prototype → Workshop</footer>
  </main>
</DemoLayout>
